{"id":"8006c9bacc56d123","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-p-adic.md","title":"P-adic","display":"df-p-adic — P-adic","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-p-adic","aliases":["58-df-p-adic","P-adic"],"display":"df-p-adic — P-adic","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-valuation.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-prime.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-field.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-analysis2-metric-completion.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-p-adic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-p-adic</span><span>P-adic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-p-adic — P-adic"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0fb569bc36cce327\" href=\"?note=0fb569bc36cce327\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-valuation.md\">../batch13/58-df-valuation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3322615e4eea05e9\" href=\"?note=3322615e4eea05e9\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-prime.md\">../batch20/58-df-prime.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1eb4a89b005d9cda\" href=\"?note=1eb4a89b005d9cda\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-field.md\">../batch13/58-df-field.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"840ef0555c7aa179\" href=\"?note=840ef0555c7aa179\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-zfc-analysis2-metric-completion.md\">../batch20/58-df-zfc-analysis2-metric-completion.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> (prime number)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v:\\mathbb Q\\to\\mathbb Z\\cup\\{\\infty\\}\">\\(v:\\mathbb Q\\to\\mathbb Z\\cup\\{\\infty\\}\\)</span> (extended valuation candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a:\\mathbb Q\\to\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\">\\(a:\\mathbb Q\\to\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\)</span> (absolute-value candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d:\\mathbb Q\\times\\mathbb Q\\to\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\">\\(d:\\mathbb Q\\times\\mathbb Q\\to\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat d:K_p\\times K_p\\to\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\">\\(\\widehat d:K_p\\times K_p\\to\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\)</span> (metrics)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i:\\mathbb Q\\to K_p\">\\(i:\\mathbb Q\\to K_p\\)</span> (dense field-embedding candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(K_p,+_p,\\cdot_p,0_p,1_p)\">\\((K_p,+_p,\\cdot_p,0_p,1_p)\\)</span> (field candidate) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal O_p\\subseteq K_p\">\\(\\mathcal O_p\\subseteq K_p\\)</span> (integer-ring candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Prime}_S(p)\">\\(\\operatorname{Prime}_S(p)\\)</span> (prime-number predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3322615e4eea05e9\" href=\"?note=3322615e4eea05e9\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-prime.md\">../batch20/58-df-prime.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Valuation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Valuation}_S\\)</span> (valuation predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0fb569bc36cce327\" href=\"?note=0fb569bc36cce327\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-valuation.md\">../batch13/58-df-valuation.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Field}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Field}_S\\)</span> (field predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"1eb4a89b005d9cda\" href=\"?note=1eb4a89b005d9cda\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-field.md\">../batch13/58-df-field.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MetricCompletion}\">\\(\\operatorname{MetricCompletion}\\)</span> (metric-completion predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"840ef0555c7aa179\" href=\"?note=840ef0555c7aa179\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-zfc-analysis2-metric-completion.md\">../batch20/58-df-zfc-analysis2-metric-completion.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PAdicValuation}_S(v,p)\">\\(\\mathrm{PAdicValuation}_S(v,p)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PAdicAbsoluteValue}_S(a,v,p)\">\\(\\mathrm{PAdicAbsoluteValue}_S(a,v,p)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PAdicPresentation}_S(K_p,p,v,a,d,\\widehat d,i,+_p,\\cdot_p,0_p,1_p)\">\\(\\mathrm{PAdicPresentation}_S(K_p,p,v,a,d,\\widehat d,i,+_p,\\cdot_p,0_p,1_p)\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PAdicField}_S(K_p,p)\">\\(\\mathrm{PAdicField}_S(K_p,p)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PAdicIntegers}_S(\\mathcal O_p,K_p,p)\">\\(\\mathrm{PAdicIntegers}_S(\\mathcal O_p,K_p,p)\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}p\\text{-}adic\\text{-}valuation} \\vdash \\mathrm{PAdicValuation}_S(v,p)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Prime}_S(p)\\land v\\in(\\mathbb Z\\cup\\{\\infty\\})^{\\mathbb Q}\\land v(0)=\\infty\\land\\mathrm{Valuation}_S(v\\upharpoonright\\mathbb Q^\\times,\\mathbb Q,\\mathbb Z)\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathbb Q^\\times\\;\\exists a_0,b_0\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\bigl(p\\nmid a_0\\land p\\nmid b_0\\land x=p^{v(x)}a_0/b_0\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}p\\text{-}adic\\text{-}valuation} \\vdash \\mathrm{PAdicValuation}_S(v,p)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Prime}_S(p)\\land v\\in(\\mathbb Z\\cup\\{\\infty\\})^{\\mathbb Q}\\land v(0)=\\infty\\land\\mathrm{Valuation}_S(v\\upharpoonright\\mathbb Q^\\times,\\mathbb Q,\\mathbb Z)\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathbb Q^\\times\\;\\exists a_0,b_0\\in\\mathbb Z\\;\\bigl(p\\nmid a_0\\land p\\nmid b_0\\land x=p^{v(x)}a_0/b_0\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}p\\text{-}adic\\text{-}absolute\\text{-}value} \\vdash \\mathrm{PAdicAbsoluteValue}_S(a,v,p)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{PAdicValuation}_S(v,p)\\land a\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}^{\\mathbb Q}\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathbb Q\\;\\left(a(x)=\\begin{cases}0,&amp;x=0,\\\\p^{-v(x)},&amp;x\\in\\mathbb Q^\\times.\\end{cases}\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}p\\text{-}adic\\text{-}absolute\\text{-}value} \\vdash \\mathrm{PAdicAbsoluteValue}_S(a,v,p)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{PAdicValuation}_S(v,p)\\land a\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}^{\\mathbb Q}\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathbb Q\\;\\left(a(x)=\\begin{cases}0,&amp;x=0,\\\\p^{-v(x)},&amp;x\\in\\mathbb Q^\\times.\\end{cases}\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}p\\text{-}adic\\text{-}presentation}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{PAdicPresentation}_S(K_p,p,v,a,d,\\widehat d,i,+_p,\\cdot_p,0_p,1_p)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{PAdicAbsoluteValue}_S(a,v,p)\\land\\forall x,y\\in\\mathbb Q\\;(d(x,y)=a(x-y))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{MetricCompletion}(\\mathbb Q,d;K_p,\\widehat d,i)\n\\land\\mathrm{Field}_S(K_p,+_p,\\cdot_p,0_p,1_p)\n\\land i(0)=0_p\\land i(1)=1_p\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y\\in\\mathbb Q\\;\\bigl(i(x+y)=i(x)+_pi(y)\\land i(xy)=i(x)\\cdot_pi(y)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}p\\text{-}adic\\text{-}presentation}\\vdash{}&amp;\\mathrm{PAdicPresentation}_S(K_p,p,v,a,d,\\widehat d,i,+_p,\\cdot_p,0_p,1_p)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{PAdicAbsoluteValue}_S(a,v,p)\\land\\forall x,y\\in\\mathbb Q\\;(d(x,y)=a(x-y))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{MetricCompletion}(\\mathbb Q,d;K_p,\\widehat d,i)\n\\land\\mathrm{Field}_S(K_p,+_p,\\cdot_p,0_p,1_p)\n\\land i(0)=0_p\\land i(1)=1_p\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y\\in\\mathbb Q\\;\\bigl(i(x+y)=i(x)+_pi(y)\\land i(xy)=i(x)\\cdot_pi(y)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}p\\text{-}adic} \\vdash \\mathrm{PAdicField}_S(K_p,p) \\leftrightarrow \\exists v,a,d,\\widehat d,i,+_p,\\cdot_p,0_p,1_p\\;\\mathrm{PAdicPresentation}_S(K_p,p,v,a,d,\\widehat d,i,+_p,\\cdot_p,0_p,1_p)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}p\\text{-}adic} \\vdash \\mathrm{PAdicField}_S(K_p,p) \\leftrightarrow \\exists v,a,d,\\widehat d,i,+_p,\\cdot_p,0_p,1_p\\;\\mathrm{PAdicPresentation}_S(K_p,p,v,a,d,\\widehat d,i,+_p,\\cdot_p,0_p,1_p)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}p\\text{-}adic\\text{-}integers} \\vdash \\mathrm{PAdicIntegers}_S(\\mathcal O_p,K_p,p) \\leftrightarrow \\exists v,a,d,\\widehat d,i,+_p,\\cdot_p,0_p,1_p\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{PAdicPresentation}_S(K_p,p,v,a,d,\\widehat d,i,+_p,\\cdot_p,0_p,1_p)\\land\\mathcal O_p=\\{x\\in K_p:\\widehat d(x,0_p)\\leq1\\}\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}p\\text{-}adic\\text{-}integers} \\vdash \\mathrm{PAdicIntegers}_S(\\mathcal O_p,K_p,p) \\leftrightarrow \\exists v,a,d,\\widehat d,i,+_p,\\cdot_p,0_p,1_p\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{PAdicPresentation}_S(K_p,p,v,a,d,\\widehat d,i,+_p,\\cdot_p,0_p,1_p)\\land\\mathcal O_p=\\{x\\in K_p:\\widehat d(x,0_p)\\leq1\\}\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>-adic: absolute value <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a(x)=p^{-v(x)}\">\\(a(x)=p^{-v(x)}\\)</span> for nonzero <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> and prime <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>; the predicate keeps the valuation, absolute value, completion metric, and dense embedding in one typed presentation.</li>\n<li>The absolute value extends uniquely and continuously from <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb Q\">\\(\\mathbb Q\\)</span> to its completion <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb Q_p\">\\(\\mathbb Q_p\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>There is a canonical topological-ring isomorphism <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb Z_p\\cong\\varprojlim_n\\mathbb Z/p^n\\mathbb Z\">\\(\\mathbb Z_p\\cong\\varprojlim_n\\mathbb Z/p^n\\mathbb Z\\)</span>; it is not literal equality of the two constructions.</li>\n<li>Hensel: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(x) \\equiv 0 \\pmod{p} \\implies\">\\(f(x) \\equiv 0 \\pmod{p} \\implies\\)</span> lifts to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>-adic root if <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f&#39;(x) \\neq 0 \\pmod{p}\">\\(f&#39;(x) \\neq 0 \\pmod{p}\\)</span></li>\n<li>Hasse--Minkowski is a local--global theorem for quadratic forms over <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb Q\">\\(\\mathbb Q\\)</span>, not for arbitrary equations.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Gouvea, p-adic Numbers</li>\n<li>Koblitz, p-adic Numbers, p-adic Analysis and Zeta-Functions</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-valuation.md","status":"resolved","id":"0fb569bc36cce327","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","headin